    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>AI创作天平：探索创作边界</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
