<body>

<div id="container">
    <h2>AI创作天平：寻找合理边界</h2>
    <div class="instruction">将下方的“行为砝码”拖入天平左右盘，观察创作的道德平衡。</div>

    <div id="weights-area">
        <div class="weight" draggable="true" data-val="left" data-type="bad">一键生成</div>
