【解题思路】引导学生算一笔“长期账”与“短期账”，对比“省力但无用”与“费力但成长”的冲突，强化“AI辅助而非替代”的行为准则。
【易错点】学生容易产生惰性依赖，认为“只要能应付过眼前的作业检查就行，考试时我再努力”，低估了长期抄袭带来的思维退化。", "knowledge_points": ["KP6"], "cognitive_level": "评价", "difficulty": 0.8, "main_id": "M6", "parent_id": "M6", "variation_type": "", "design_intent": "通过直观的学习效果对比，帮助普通生克服“图省事直接抄”的本能诱惑，将自律公约中“合理使用AI辅助学习”的规则转化为长期的自觉行为。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "设计一个“学习效果模拟器”SVG动画。并排展示小明（直接抄袭）和小红（思路引导）的“大脑知识库”。学生拖动“时间推进”滑块（从第1周到第4周），观察两人大脑的变化：小明的大脑知识库始终呈灰色且有漏洞，考试时亮起红色警告；小红的大脑知识库逐渐填满金色知识节点，考试时亮起绿色通过。直观揭示“替代思考”与“辅助思考”对个人成长的长期影响。", "visual_aid_type": "diagram", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>AI时代学习效果模拟器</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: #f0f2f5;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .container {
            width: 80vw;
            max-width: 800px;
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h2 { text-align: center; color: #333; margin-top: 0; }
        .controls { margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        input[type=range] { width: 80%; cursor: pointer; }
        .stage-label { font-weight: bold; color: #555; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        svg { width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; }
        .legend { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9em; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>学习效果模拟器：谁是自律学习者？</h2>

    <div class="controls">
        <div class="stage-label" id="weekLabel">当前进度：第 1 周</div>
        <input type="range" id="timeSlider" min="1" max="4" step="1" value="1">
    </div>

    <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" id="simSvg">
        <!-- 小明区域 -->
        <g id="mingGroup">
            <text x="150" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">小明（直接抄袭）</text>
            <rect x="50" y="50" width="200" height="180" fill="#f9f9f9" stroke="#ccc" rx="10"/>
            <circle id="mingBrain" cx="150" cy="140" r="50" fill="#ddd" stroke="#999" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text id="mingStatus" x="150" y="260" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666">知识库：空洞</text>
        </g>

        <!-- 小红区域 -->
        <g id="hongGroup">
            <text x="450" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold">小红（思路引导）</text>
            <rect x="350" y="50" width="200" height="180" fill="#f9f9f9" stroke="#ccc" rx="10"/>
            <circle id="hongBrain" cx="450" cy="140" r="50" fill="#ddd" stroke="#999" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text id="hongStatus" x="450" y="260" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666">知识库：萌芽</text>
        </g>
    </svg>

    <div class="legend">
        <span><span style="color:#ddd">■</span> 未掌握</span>
        <span><span style="color:#FFD700">■</span> 已内化</span>
        <span><span style="color:#ff4d4f">■</span> 考试预警</span>
        <span><span style="color:#52c41a">■</span> 考试通过</span>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    const slider = document.getElementById('timeSlider');
    const weekLabel = document.getElementById('weekLabel');
    const mingBrain = document.getElementById('mingBrain');
    const hongBrain = document.getElementById('hongBrain');
    const mingStatus = document.getElementById('mingStatus');
    const hongStatus = document.getElementById('hongStatus');

    function updateSimulation() {
        const week = parseInt(slider.value);
        weekLabel.textContent = `当前进度：第 ${week} 周`;

        // 小明逻辑：始终灰色，第4周变红（考试失败）
        if (week < 4) {
            mingBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#ddd');
            mingStatus.textContent = "知识库：空洞";
        } else {
            mingBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#ff4d4f');
            mingStatus.textContent = "考试结果：不及格 (警告)";
        }

        // 小红逻辑：逐渐变金，第4周变绿（考试成功）
        if (week === 1) {
            hongBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#ddd');
            hongStatus.textContent = "知识库：萌芽";
        } else if (week === 2) {
            hongBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#ffe58f');
            hongStatus.textContent = "知识库：积累中";
        } else if (week === 3) {
            hongBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#FFD700');
            hongStatus.textContent = "知识库：扎实";
        } else {
            hongBrain.setAttribute('fill', '#52c41a');
            hongStatus.textContent = "考试结果：优秀 (通过)";
        }
    }

    slider.addEventListener('input', updateSimulation);
</script>

</body>
</html>", "visual_aid_urls": [], "priority": 0.88}, {"id": "S1-1-1", "content": "当你在手机上用普通相机拍照，和用“AI换脸软件”拍照时，这两个软件分别拿走了你的什么信息呢？", "question_type": "scaffold", "lesson_presentation_script": "同学们, 刚才我们聊到智能音箱在‘偷听’。现在我们来看看大家最喜欢的‘AI换脸’。你想一想，平时用普通相机拍张照片，照片就存在你自己的手机里；但当你把照片上传到‘AI换脸App’时，它除了拿到一张照片，还悄悄分析并拿走了你脸上哪些独一无二的特征呢？", "explanation": "期望回答方向：普通相机只保存照片文件在本地，而AI换脸App会提取并上传人脸的五官比例、骨骼轮廓等高维生物特征数据。教师可以通过引导学生观察换脸时脸上出现的“网格扫描线”来判断学生是否理解了数据被提取的过程。", "knowledge_points": ["KP1", "KP2"], "cognitive_level": "理解", "difficulty": 0.25, "from_id": "M1", "to_id": "M2", "from_main_id": "M1", "to_main_id": "M2", "bridge_group_id": "BG1-1", "bridge_function": "", "design_intent": "引导学生对比普通相机与AI换脸软件的区别，识别出被收集的“核心隐私数据”（人脸特征），为理解生物特征隐私打下基础。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "设计一个自包含的交互式HTML/SVG对比图：左侧是“普通相机”，右侧是“AI换脸App”。点击“普通相机”按钮，显示照片保存在本地手机相册的绿色动画；点击“AI换脸App”按钮，手机屏幕上的人脸出现蓝色特征点网格，并显示动态数据流向“云端服务器”的动画，提示文字：“它正在提取你的面部生物特征”。", "visual_aid_type": "diagram", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>信息技术：拍照背后的数据流向</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #2563eb; --bg: #f8fafc; --text: #1e293b; }
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 800px; text-align: center; }
        .controls { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        button { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; border: none; border-radius: 8px; background: #e2e8f0; margin: 0 10px; transition: 0.3s; }
        button.active { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
        #canvas-area { width: 100%; height: 400px; background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .info-box { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 1.2rem; height: 3em; color: #64748b; }
        svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
        .hidden { display: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>拍照时，数据去了哪里？</h2>
    <div class="controls">
        <button id="btn-camera">普通相机</button>
        <button id="btn-ai">AI换脸App</button>
    </div>
    <div id="canvas-area">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300">
            <!-- 手机主体 -->
            <rect x="250" y="50" width="100" height="180" rx="10" fill="#334155" />
            <rect x="265" y="70" width="70" height="120" fill="#cbd5e1" />

            <!-- 动画元素 -->
            <g id="anim-layer"></g>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box" id="msg">请点击上方按钮进行观察</div>
</div>

<script>
    const animLayer = document.getElementById('anim-layer');
    const msg = document.getElementById('msg');
    const btnCamera = document.getElementById('btn-camera');
    const btnAi = document.getElementById('btn-ai');

    function clearAnim() { animLayer.innerHTML = ''; }

    btnCamera.addEventListener('click', () => {
        clearAnim();
        btnCamera.classList.add('active');
        btnAi.classList.remove('active');
        msg.innerText = "普通相机：照片直接存储在手机本地相册中。";

        // 动画：照片进入相册
        animLayer.innerHTML = `
            <rect x="270" y="80" width="60" height="100" fill="#94a3b8" />
            <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate" from="0 0" to="0 50" dur="1s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
            <text x="300" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="white">相册</text>
        `;
    });

    btnAi.addEventListener('click', () => {
        clearAnim();
        btnAi.classList.add('active');
        btnCamera.classList.remove('active');
        msg.innerText = "AI换脸App：正在提取面部特征点并上传至云端服务器...";

        // 动画：特征点网格
        animLayer.innerHTML = `
            <circle cx="300" cy="130" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" />
            <line x1="280" y1="110" x2="320" y2="150" stroke="#3b82f6" />
            <line x1="320" y1="110" x2="280" y2="150" stroke="#3b82f6" />
            <circle cx="290" cy="120" r="3" fill="#3b82f6" />
            <circle cx="310" cy="120" r="3" fill="#3b82f6" />

            <!-- 数据流向 -->
            <rect x="450" y="50" width="100" height="60" rx="5" fill="#f1f5f9" stroke="#3b82f6" />
            <text x="500" y="85" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14">云端服务器</text>
            <line x1="350" y1="130" x2="450" y2="80" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-dasharray="5,5">
                <animate attributeName="stroke-dashoffset" from="100" to="0" dur="1s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
            </line>
        `;
    });
</script>

</body>
</html>", "visual_aid_urls": [], "priority": 0.65}, {"id": "S1-1-2", "content": "如果家里的钥匙丢了，我们可以换一把锁；但如果你的“人脸数据”被别人拿走了，你能给自己的脸“换一把锁”吗？这会带来什么麻烦？", "question_type": "scaffold", "lesson_presentation_script": "钥匙丢了，换个锁芯就安全了。但是，我们的人脸、声音是天生的，是世界上独一无二的‘生物钥匙’。如果这些数据在网上被泄露了，我们能去换一张脸或者换个声音吗？如果不能，坏人可能会用它来做什么呢？", "explanation": "期望回答方向：不能换脸。人脸和声音具有唯一性和终身不可更改性，一旦泄露，可能会被坏人用来进行AI换脸诈骗、伪造身份刷脸支付等，造成无法挽回的损失。教师可根据学生是否说出“无法更改”和“冒充身份”来评估其跨越台阶的情况。", "knowledge_points": ["KP2"], "cognitive_level": "理解", "difficulty": 0.32, "from_id": "M1", "to_id": "M2", "from_main_id": "M1", "to_main_id": "M2", "bridge_group_id": "BG1-1", "bridge_function": "", "design_intent": "通过“实体钥匙”与“人脸钥匙”的类比，帮学生理解生物特征泄露的永久性危害，建立防范意识。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "设计一个交互式“钥匙与人脸”对比页面。左边是一把实体钥匙和一把锁，点击“丢钥匙”按钮，锁变成红色，点击“换锁”按钮，锁变回绿色安全状态；右边是一张人脸和刷脸支付终端，点击“泄露人脸”按钮，人脸变红，点击“换脸”按钮，弹出提示：“警告：生物特征终身无法更改！”，右侧终端显示“被冒名顶替”的警示动画。", "visual_aid_type": "illustration", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>S1-1-2 钥匙与人脸的安全性对比</title>
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #2c3e50; --safe: #27ae60; --danger: #e74c3c; }
        body { font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; background: #f4f7f6; color: var(--primary); }
        .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; width: 90%; max-width: 800px; gap: 20px; }
        .box { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-align: center; flex: 1; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .visual { height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        button { padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; border: none; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--primary); color: white; font-size: 1rem; margin: 5px; transition: 0.3s; }
        button:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
        #warning { color: var(--danger); font-weight: bold; height: 20px; margin-top: 10px; visibility: hidden; }
        .icon { font-size: 60px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- 实体钥匙区 -->
        <div class="box">
            <h2>实体钥匙</h2>
            <div class="visual" id="key-zone">
                <div id="lock-icon" class="icon" style="color: var(--safe);">🔒</div>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-lose">丢钥匙</button>
            <button id="btn-change-lock">换锁</button>
        </div>

        <!-- 人脸数据区 -->
        <div class="box">
            <h2>人脸数据</h2>
            <div class="visual" id="face-zone">
                <div id="face-icon" class="icon" style="color: var(--safe);">👤</div>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-leak">泄露人脸</button>
            <button id="btn-change-face">换脸</button>
            <div id="warning">警告：生物特征终身无法更改！</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const lockIcon = document.getElementById('lock-icon');
        const faceIcon = document.getElementById('face-icon');
        const warning = document.getElementById('warning');

        // 实体钥匙逻辑
        document.getElementById('btn-lose').addEventListener('click', () => {
            lockIcon.style.color = 'var(--danger)';
            lockIcon.textContent = '🔓';
        });

        document.getElementById('btn-change-lock').addEventListener('click', () => {
            lockIcon.style.color = 'var(--safe)';
            lockIcon.textContent = '🔒';
        });

        // 人脸数据逻辑
        document.getElementById('btn-leak').addEventListener('click', () => {
            faceIcon.style.color = 'var(--danger)';
            faceIcon.textContent = '🚫';
            warning.style.visibility = 'hidden';
        });

        document.getElementById('btn-change-face').addEventListener('click', () => {
            warning.style.visibility = 'visible';
            // 模拟动画效果
            faceIcon.style.transform = 'scale(1.2)';
            setTimeout(() => { faceIcon.style.transform = 'scale(1)'; }, 200);
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>", "visual_aid_urls": [], "priority": 0.65}, {"id": "S1-2-1", "content": "平时下载新游戏点击“我同意”时，你有没有注意到旁边那些密密麻麻的小字？我们通常可以在这些小字的什么位置找到关于“相机、麦克风权限”的说明？", "question_type": "scaffold", "lesson_presentation_script": "大家下载好玩的App时，是不是都恨不得一秒钟点完‘同意’开始玩？其实，那些不显眼的小字里藏着大秘密。今天我们来当一回‘侦探’，找一找在那些很长很长的协议里，通常在哪个部分会写着‘允许软件使用你的摄像头或录音’？", "explanation": "期望回答方向：通常在“隐私政策”、“权限申请”或“数据收集与使用”等章节中。教师应引导学生知道这些关键词，以便在实际生活中快速检索权限陷阱。", "knowledge_points": ["KP2"], "cognitive_level": "记忆", "difficulty": 0.28, "from_id": "M1", "to_id": "M2", "from_main_id": "M1", "to_main_id": "M2", "bridge_group_id": "BG1-2", "bridge_function": "", "design_intent": "引导学生关注平时被忽略的“用户协议”小字，培养在安装App时寻找关键授权条款的习惯。", "design_rationale": "", "visual_aid_prompt": "设计一个“协议放大镜”交互页面。模拟一个手机安装软件的界面，中间是密密麻麻的灰色用户协议文字。学生可以拖动一个“高亮放大镜”在文本上移动。当放大镜移动到写有“收集用户人脸、无限期使用权”的红色段落时，文字自动放大并闪烁，同时旁边出现一个黄色叹号提示：“注意：这里有不合理授权条款！”", "visual_aid_type": "illustration", "visual_aid_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
